    "body": "### Contributing guidelines\r\n\r\n- [X] I have read [CONTRIBUTING.md](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/main/CONTRIBUTING.md)\r\n- [X] I have read [CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/main/CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md)\r\n\r\n### Module(s)\r\n\r\nmini.pairs\r\n\r\n### Description\r\n\r\nusing luasnip\r\n\r\n<img width=\"625\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/assets/19513289/47a5ae5d-a105-450e-b9fb-d83d6ad700a1\">\r\n\r\ninput the `{`\r\n\r\n<img width=\"625\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/assets/19513289/f213a2c9-fe15-42c7-b8a8-903fad5469be\">\r\n\r\ni am expect the result is\r\n\r\n```lua\r\nvim.api.nvim_create_autocmd('FileType', {|}) -- | is the input cursor\r\n```\r\n\r\nPS: my neovim setup is from [LazyVim](https://github.com/LazyVim/LazyVim)",
